# 小東老師電子學 videos

The user's channel is 小東老師電子學. Gold-standard Grok Bot episode: https://youtu.be/bN9DOArGQbE (集膚效應).

When making a tutorial video:

- Do not search `electricity`, `lightning`, `電力`, `電工`. That is why Cursor footage looks stupid next to Grok Bot.
- Clone this grammar: 現場問題 → dark-navy mechanism slides → 金句 → 實務取捨.
- Imagine is ONLY the photoreal hero metaphor (copper skin current, welded contacts). The Imagine prompt must contain **no text**.
- All 金句 / captions / badges are composited on slides via `tools/tutorial_video`. Never ask Grok 4.6 or Imagine to write Chinese into the pixels.
- Command: `python3 -m tools.tutorial_video plan --lesson skin-effect` then `render`. Add `--imagine` only for the hero, needs `XAI_API_KEY`.
- Do not turn the foodrecipe homepage into this series.
